Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:03.07,main,SUBORDINATE B,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:05.28,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You don't have to order me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:08.34,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,You didn't even realize \Nyou'd been kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:10.36,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,You're quite the dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:14.55,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:16.50,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:17.64,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:18.33,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:19.37,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:20.29,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:21.00,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:21.75,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:22.52,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:27.38,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I was raised to be the Annovazzi \Nfamily heir despite being the youngest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:31.49,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,because I was the strongest \Nof all my sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:33.30,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:41.19,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You handled yourself quite impressively.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:44.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You saw everything! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:46.98,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,My life as a noblewoman is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:54.08,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That must've been quite the fright. \NYou poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:01:00.30,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,No one's ever said that to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:02.63,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:05.25,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:07.96,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:28.48,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFEFEFD&\an8\fs40\c&H1B1A20&\shad0\bord4\fad(1782,1)}Always a {\c&H8971F4&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:27.33,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an8\move(20,320,330,320)\c&H303637&\3c&HECF6F5&\fs8\frz-4.09\shad0}Knight Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:43.02,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs27\3c&HF4F3FC&}Episode 3
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:43.02,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0}How I {\c&HD29E5C&}Trained to Become {\c&H8A74F6&}a Lady
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.86,main,HEAD MAID,0,0,0,,You look beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.49,0:02:52.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:56.25,main,HEAD MAID,0,0,0,,Yes. You look like a lovely \Nlady from every angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:02:59.95,main,HEAD MAID,0,0,0,,Even the king and queen \Nwill sing your praises.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:04.12,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What should I do? I'm so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:08.21,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,20)\an8\3c&H995923&\shad0\fs25\c&HEEBD57&}WANDER WANDER
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:08.21,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Things progressed rapidly after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:14.88,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Baron Casciari and Lady Eleonora were \Narrested for bribery and kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:18.18,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,The crown prince ceremony \Nwas held afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:20.89,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,with Renato becoming crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:31.23,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,About your meeting with my family...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:32.75,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your family...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:36.15,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You mean royals!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:38.41,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,This is the date and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:41.41,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You've already scheduled it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:47.04,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Today is the day \NI formally become engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:52.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I wonder what Prince Renato's \Nfamily are like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.18,0:03:56.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I hope they're as friendly \Nas Prince Placido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:04.68,main,HEAD MAID,0,0,0,,Lady Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:06.93,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H9DADF8&\3c&H6262DD&\shad0\t(1,2250,\fsp6)\pos(483,40)}ZOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.48,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Act like a lady. Don't do anything weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:16.99,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:22.92,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I practiced a bunch with Aida, so... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.95,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:27.96,main,MAIDS,0,0,0,,Lady Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:28.91,main,MAIDS,0,0,0,,Lady Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:30.12,main,MAIDS,0,0,0,,Lady Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:32.25,main,HEAD MAID,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.71,main,HEAD MAID,0,0,0,,She's so quick. By the time \Nwe noticed, she was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:39.34,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Well, that's Mimi. It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:43.90,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,She can't have left the castle grounds. \NSearch every corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:45.06,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:50.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I feel like I passed through here earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:55.48,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,We found her, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:04:59.21,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.43,0:05:06.70,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:12.60,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Prince Renato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.93,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Are you all right? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:16.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:18.63,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.63,0:05:21.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Um, I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:25.93,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He was lost in the bushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.81,main,QUEEN DOWAGER,0,0,0,,My little Macaron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:32.72,main,QUEEN DOWAGER,0,0,0,,Where have you been? \NI've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:36.36,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? He's Your Majesty's puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:39.43,main,QUEEN DOWAGER,0,0,0,,Yes. I've been so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:43.95,main,QUEEN DOWAGER,0,0,0,,Thank you for finding him, \NMs. Maria Annovazzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:46.09,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.09,0:05:49.91,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Not only did I keep you waiting, \Nbut I'm a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:54.92,main,KING,0,0,0,,What an amusing young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:57.08,main,PLATIDO,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:59.46,main,PLATIDO,0,0,0,,It's rude to laugh so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.38,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(22,119)\c&H0678F1&\3c&H0672C6&\shad0}AH HA HA HA
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:08.65,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Um, Your Highness, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:14.71,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That's my Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:24.11,main,KING,0,0,0,,I've never seen Renato \Nmake that expression before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:26.82,main,KING,0,0,0,,It's not easy to find a girl like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:29.40,main,KING,0,0,0,,Where in the world did he find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:30.66,main,KING,0,0,0,,Right, darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:34.45,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HAC244F&\3c&H81143B&\shad0\pos(595,146)\fad(1,307)}HMPH
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:41.95,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,In any case, I became \Ncrown princess on this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:55.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'd better study hard so I can \Nbecome a lovely crown princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:58.57,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:03.57,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Ladies don't skip through \Nthe royal academy halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:04.73,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:05.32,sign_Verdana,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(490,220)\c&H525FEE&\3c&H75ECFF&\shad0\bord3\fad(1,521)}STOP!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:08.26,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You mustn't skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:11.79,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You're making everyone else \Nget out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:14.55,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sorry, Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:18.25,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Let's work hard to make you \Na crown princess, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:21.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Okay. I look forward to \Nlearning with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:29.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But originally, you were supposed to \Nbecome the crown princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:32.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,If this damages your reputation...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:36.89,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about that, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:40.31,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I feel like Aida's been \Nmore cheerful recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:42.98,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Very well, Aida. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:47.82,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But ideally, I'd like to start \Ntraining after our next break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:51.47,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm going back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:54.76,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I finally get to see my baby \Nbrother Teodorico again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:57.33,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Oh, you settled on dates?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:59.87,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I thought you wouldn't \Nbe going until later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.07,0:08:03.69,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You have so much to prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:09.26,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Prince Placido said Prince Renato \Nwouldn't want to let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:11.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Aw, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.00,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:16.27,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to the royal \Ncastle to see His Highness today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:19.15,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Very well. \NThen I'll head home without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:20.73,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll be home in time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:27.99,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fad(194,390)\move(215,35,305,40,1,361)\c&H5A595A&\3c&H444043&\shad3\4c&HC4B1BE&\fsp1}LOOM...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.81,0:08:29.54,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,And now she's running.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:32.24,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You're here, Lord Raimondo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:35.27,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Will her training go all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.27,0:08:37.24,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You've seen how it's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:42.54,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,But she's athletic. She'll pick up \Non royal etiquette quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:47.45,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Can anything be done about \Nher habit of speaking her mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:53.01,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm leaving that the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:55.26,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,It's one of her strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:59.44,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,But that could lead \Nto trouble once she becomes queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:00.89,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:06.01,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,She doesn't think thoughts \Nthat would upset others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:08.15,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Probably not, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:12.54,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Watch this. Speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:16.20,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,That's Lady Rosalia Pinotti, \Nthe marquis' daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:19.05,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,who'd been pursuing Prince Renato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:23.43,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I heard she harassed you quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:28.26,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,Why, Lady Maria, how do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:31.59,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fs25\frz18.28\pos(120,120)\c&HA9AEF8&\3c&H9778F5&\shad0\4c&H78D3FA&\fsp6\fad(536,1)}HUH?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:31.59,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,How do you do, Lady Rosalia?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.69,0:09:36.64,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,No wonder this area \Nsmells like the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:39.26,main,FOLLOWER 2,0,0,0,,Indeed, Lady Rosalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:43.73,main,FOLLOWER 1,0,0,0,,Do I smell a pasture? \NYou betray your origins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:49.99,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,I hope your stench doesn't make \NPrince Renato fall out of love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:10:01.08,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You smell lovely, Lady Rosalia. \NAre you wearing perfume?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:05.08,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,Of course. All ladies wear perfume.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:10.91,main,FOLLOWER 1,0,0,0,,Are you unaware the Pinotti Marquisate \Nis famous for its perfume?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.91,0:10:15.34,main,FOLLOWER 2,0,0,0,,Perhaps you've never seen perfume \Nmade using natural essential oils.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:18.66,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Natural essential oil perfume?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:20.56,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Do you have that with you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:20.39,sign_TrebuchetMS,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(327,267)\fs15\c&H2C2B32&\3c&HFEFFFF&\shad0\fad(1,438)}TWITCH
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.67,0:10:24.35,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,I shall let you in on a little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:30.31,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,Our perfumes aren't just fragrant. \NThey're moisturizing as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:35.53,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,They also contain ground shells, \Nwhich make your skin more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:37.10,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:37.66,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fad(112,315)\c&HD28FF6&\3c&HFFE4FF&\shad0\frz344.7\pos(356,108)}RUB RUB
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:41.29,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It smells lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.46,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It really does make your skin sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:45.62,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,Doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:49.41,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Perfume amazing. Want to take home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:51.38,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,Why are you speaking like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.92,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,They speak common in the Kingdom of Muro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:58.90,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? Lady Rosalia, you're familiar \Nwith the Kingdom of Muro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:03.64,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,Of course. As a noble, \NI've studied all the nearby nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:08.56,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:13.53,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(160,12)\c&H474BF2&\3c&H3E1F98&\shad0}SWING
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:13.53,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(484,17)\c&H474BF2&\3c&H3E1F98&\shad0}SWING
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:13.53,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm delighted you even \Nstudied my little kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:16.98,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,It's a shame you had to \Ngrow up in the countryside
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:18.63,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,surrounded by nothing but pastures.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:23.12,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,I doubt you've ever been to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:27.29,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're right. \NHave you been, Lady Rosalia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:32.38,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,I enjoy vacationing by the sea \Nevery year at my villa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:36.50,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Wow, that sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:41.39,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'd love to see the blue seas \Nand glittering spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.39,0:11:44.60,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The seafood must be delicious as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.84,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,And at night, you can enjoy fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:50.51,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The stars must be beautiful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:53.43,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'd love to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.43,0:11:57.67,main,FOLLOWER 1,0,0,0,,Lady Rosalia, don't be fooled \Ninto thinking that might be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:59.56,main,FOLLOWER 2,0,0,0,,Lady Rosalia, come to your senses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:06.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I don't have a swimsuit. \NWould you help me choose one?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.54,0:12:08.04,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(76,185)\c&H86CBF7&\3c&H1A2BC6&\shad0}QUIVER\NQUIVER
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:08.04,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(76,185)\c&H86CBF7&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord4}QUIVER\NQUIVER
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.54,0:12:08.04,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(467,177)\c&H86CBF7&\3c&H1A2BC6&\shad0}QUIVER\NQUIVER
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:08.04,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(467,177)\c&H86CBF7&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord4}QUIVER\NQUIVER
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:08.04,main,FOLLOWER 1,0,0,0,,Lady Rosalia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:10.34,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.34,0:12:14.04,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,I'll invite you to vacation with me \Nthis summer, so prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:16.69,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,I'll contact my childhood friend's store \Nregarding a swimsuit for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.69,0:12:18.88,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,You'd better be prepared...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:20.92,main,ROSALIA,0,0,0,,for what's in store!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:22.49,main,FOLLOWERS,0,0,0,,Lady Rosalia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:25.89,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Okay! I'm looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.25,0:12:28.27,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.27,0:12:30.84,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to be seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.27,0:12:34.53,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi even treats Lady Rosalia that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:39.49,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,And she'd fight everyone off \Nif they bothered her physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:41.95,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,It's good that she's so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.95,0:12:45.28,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Didn't her meeting the other day go well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:49.04,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Yes, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.33,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mostly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.03,0:12:54.37,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,There's something \NI must give to Lady Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:55.92,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:57.34,sign_Verdana,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HD8A872&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0}STEP STEP STEP STEP...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:56.97,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:01.84,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Hey, Lord Raimondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.56,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:04.76,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Lady Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:07.43,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:10.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,This kitty is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:16.58,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,This reminds me of your \Nmeeting and the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.87,0:13:22.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,She doesn't like me, does she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:29.75,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Aida said the queen seemed interested \Nwhen she told her about me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:34.13,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I definitely disappointed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.13,0:13:37.49,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,The queen is rather \Nstrict about etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:42.09,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,The king and queen dowager like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:49.55,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,but the queen has doubts that you're \Nworthy of being crown princess of Rubini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:53.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'd like to be on friendly terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:56.77,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,After all, she's Prince Renato's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:14:00.40,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,There's no point \Nin worrying about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:04.34,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:06.72,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,An invitation from the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:08.98,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,She'd like the two of you to have tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:13.58,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,This may be a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:24.00,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\c&H141824&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\an1\frz11.98\pos(367,247)}Always a {\c&H8873F3&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:35.48,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mimi, I'm sorry for keeping you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:38.79,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Highness, did you run here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:42.86,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Forgive me. I was in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:46.11,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fad(691,1)\move(105,95,80,65)\frz42.92\fs15\shad0\c&H7B6EEB&\3c&H4E2DAE&}SO HANDSOME
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:46.11,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.11,0:14:48.76,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You seem quite busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:52.12,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Yes. I suddenly have so much more to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:55.67,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That's why I couldn't wait to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:57.58,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(222,245)\c&H7D6EF3&\3c&H5427C7&\shad0\bord2}BLUSH
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:04.13,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That hairpin suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.09,0:15:07.09,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:12.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's worn by direct female descendants \Nof the Annovazzi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:15.00,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,They're based on our family crest, \Nbut each design is custom made.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:18.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,When we marry, our partner's family crest \Nis incorporated into the design.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:23.84,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Then you'll have to get a new one \Nmade based on the royal crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.20,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The royal crest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:28.95,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,B-But I'm not worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:32.79,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Don't say that. \NIt's your family tradition, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:34.37,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:38.62,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you. \NMy family will be delighted as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:40.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I must tell them when I return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.63,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:46.72,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(315,55)\c&H53102E&\3c&HE9D6DB&\shad0\fsp1}GLOOM...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:45.53,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Do you promise you'll come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:47.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:48.72,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H3EFFFF&\3c&H41A4CE&\shad0\move(80,80,70,75)\frz21.39}SMILE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I have school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:51.60,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(315,55)\c&H53102E&\3c&HE9D6DB&\shad0\fsp1}GLOOM...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:51.60,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,A-And I want to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:15:52.22,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H3EFFFF&\3c&H41A4CE&\shad0\move(80,80,70,75)\frz21.39}SMILE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:54.11,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:57.81,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,He doesn't need to worry so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:16:05.09,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,But this lovely prince makes time \Nfor me and notices my hairpin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:08.32,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,It's disconcerting, but \Nit makes me so happy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:13.24,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,But I might not want to leave \Nonce I see Teodorico.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:14.59,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:17.54,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That's your baby brother, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:19.29,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I spoke my mind again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:23.01,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I'm already used to that habit of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.01,0:16:24.38,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:27.75,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I brought you the list, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:28.89,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:34.30,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,This is a list of gifts \Nfor the Annovazzi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.39,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I hope they like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:41.86,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs25\c&H3D3EF0&\3c&H000000&\shad0}THUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.05,0:16:40.23,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,We love receiving anything \Nthat doesn't make us sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:41.86,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That's encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:45.57,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Also, is one day enough \Nto see your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:46.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? That's so short.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:49.24,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I told him that was too short, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:51.78,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,It takes six days \Nto travel there and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:58.37,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,We can take our time when \NI go with you to see your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:17:02.53,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Highness, Lord Raimondo is watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:04.13,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:10.22,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs15\pos(266,133)\c&H9A3A60&\3c&HFFF8FF&\shad0}STRUGGLE\NSTRUGGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:10.22,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(543,127)\fs15\c&H9A3A60&\3c&HFFF8FF&\shad0}STRUGGLE\NSTRUGGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:09.16,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You're surprisingly strong, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:10.22,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.22,0:17:14.92,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Actually, your movements are \Nso dull, it's harder to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:16.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What is this? You're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:20.48,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H404145&\3c&HF5F6F6&\shad0\bord3}SURRENDER
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:24.16,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I can't wait to give you a new hairpin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:24.98,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&HC097F6&\3c&HFDF5FF&\shad0\frz-27.9\fad(1,228)\move(480,90,520,75)}KISS
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:29.94,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H363636&\3c&HF6F6F6&\shad0\pos(491,320)}OVER CAPACITY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:29.94,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H9887F1&\3c&H6A609D&\shad0\fad(1,387)\fs25}KISS
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:29.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Um, Prince Renato...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:35.59,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Your Highness, Lady Maria is having \Ntea with the queen after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:37.68,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Please release her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:42.60,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Mother scheduled her tea party \Nto interrupt our time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:44.63,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,That's not nice of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:47.26,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:51.55,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It seems the queen doesn't like me much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:54.84,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I don't think that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:18:00.85,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll see you again \Nbefore I leave for Muro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:04.16,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Don't work too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:05.27,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:12.83,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Prince Renato assigned knights to me \Neven within the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:16.95,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Not to guard me, but to \Nprevent me from getting lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:20.33,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I want to be protected, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:26.75,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I thought I sensed someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.75,0:18:34.09,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So this is the queen's garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:38.14,main,SERVER,0,0,0,,Lady Maria, we've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:42.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Where is the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:46.44,main,SERVER,0,0,0,,She'll be here shortly. Please wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:55.70,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:59.75,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you for inviting me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.75,0:19:03.80,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I hope you are well, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:06.17,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,No need to be so formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.99,0:19:11.17,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:12.54,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:15.80,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&HDD5B90&\3c&H490C2A&\shad0\an7\fs25}STARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:17.02,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,She's staring so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:20.19,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Did I screw up my initial greeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:23.34,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,She sighed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:24.20,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:26.35,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,It's been five seconds, and \Nshe's already sick of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:31.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Uh, um... etiquette... tea... treats...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:32.03,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H64D3F8&\3c&H3194D9&\shad0\move(80,85,75,80)\frz21.26}YOINK
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:32.91,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H64D3F8&\3c&H3194D9&\shad0\move(230,40,230,35)\frz21.26}YOINK
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:33.69,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H64D3F8&\3c&H3194D9&\shad0\move(590,150,595,150)\an8\frz21.26}YOINK
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:37.96,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Start with the tastiest treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.33,0:19:40.03,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:42.62,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,That's right. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:47.87,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,When acting like a lady, take small bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.87,0:19:50.75,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Drink your tea without making a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.75,0:19:52.61,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,And smile gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:54.51,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.39,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.80,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs30\c&H373DEE&\3c&H1E2530&\shad0\bord3}BANG
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:20:00.30,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,"How's that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:04.14,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Were you speaking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:07.38,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I spoke my mind again! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:10.19,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Well, your manners are acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:13.57,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:20.28,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.00,main,KNIGHT 1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:33.50,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,That came from a castle window.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:35.26,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.26,0:20:37.63,main,KNIGHT 1,0,0,0,,Lady Maria, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:43.55,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,More importantly, the queen and culprit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:46.77,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,She's shaking. Of course she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:49.56,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,She was suddenly attacked. \NThat must've been terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:54.13,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you're all right now. \NLet's return to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.13,0:20:55.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.11,0:20:55.73,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&HFA8E5A&\3c&HD03419&\bord1.5\4c&HDB4B25&\an4\move(125,30,120,25)\fad(1,476)}SHOVE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:56.61,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.61,0:20:57.32,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:58.42,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:00.45,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:05.95,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,You are so super cool, Mimi! I adore you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.23,0:21:07.23,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:10.48,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,You're as strong as Aida said you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:13.16,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Did you see how she kicked \Nthe table into the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:17.98,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,I wish I could've seen you fight \NBaron Casciari's assassins!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:22.03,top,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Why does Renato get everything? \NIt's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:25.64,top,QUEEN,0,0,0,,You're simply the best, Mimi! \NYou're so cool!
