Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:23.80,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Y-Your Majesty, you \Nmustn't slap the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:25.64,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You'll get your hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:27.32,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:30.73,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,I'll dirty my hands if that's \Nwhat it takes to praise your valor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:34.12,top,QUEEN,0,0,0,,I love you, Mimi! Squee!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:38.19,top,QUEEN,0,0,0,,I love, love, love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:34.50,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what happened, \Nbut she's lost her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.50,0:21:36.48,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Take her to a doctor quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.48,0:21:37.66,main,KNIGHT 1,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.19,0:21:40.86,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(462,302)\c&H338C6B&\3c&HEEFFF6&\shad0\bord4}DRAG DRAG
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.19,0:21:41.91,top,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Stay here tonight, Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.91,0:21:44.49,top,QUEEN,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:44.49,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:53.17,main,IRENEO,0,0,0,,Well, well. You're even more \Ninteresting than expected, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:55.00,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(408,260)\fs28}To be continued
