Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.74,0:23:29.26,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The queen showed me that tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.26,0:23:31.29,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It had so many big jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:33.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I was surprised by how heavy it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:35.57,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The queen is quite the tough woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.57,0:23:37.09,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,After all, she and the king actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.09,0:23:39.45,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, I spoke my mind again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.02,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs19\3c&HF4F3FC&}Next Time
